Open source is the future of SaaS.

@marclou built his newsletter tool with a few prompts in Opus 5.5, which means anyone can. Code is no longer a moat.

So you might as well give it away and let it be your free marketing. There will always be lazy people who’d rather pay you to host it.

@wickedguro did exactly this with Postiz and it now makes $245k MRR.
